# Markdown is deliberately NOT formatted, and this is a scope decision rather
# than an oversight (STOURIFY-163).
#
# The prose in this repository is written to a standard that lives outside it --
# saas-boilerplate/docs/system-wide-docs/system-teaching-docs-standard.md -- and
# the same standard governs the documentation in three other repositories that
# prettier does not run in. Formatting one repository's prose to a tool's
# opinion, while its three siblings keep the standard's, produces drift in a body
# of writing that is supposed to read as one thing. Better all four by hand than
# one by machine.
#
# CHANGELOG.md and changelogs/ have a second reason: they are append-only
# records. Reformatting history is churn on files nobody re-reads.
#
# What IS formatted is code -- .ts, .tsx, .js, .json, .yaml -- which is what the
# accident in STOURIFY-162 happened to and what the gate exists for.
*.md
